@startuml kairos-department-service-attendance-tracker-sequence
title Department Service Attendance Tracker

actor "Department Leader" as Leader
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Leader -> WebAdmin: Open Department Attendance page
WebAdmin -> API: GET /departments/{id}/attendance?date=...
API -> DB: SELECT recent attendance, members list
DB --> API: Data
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

Leader -> WebAdmin: Mark each member present/absent\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /departments/{id}/attendance {entries}
API -> DB: UPSERT DepartmentAttendance records
DB --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

WebAdmin --> Leader: Show saved confirmation

@enduml
